							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "The concept is that"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "a program in which user can create an array on his own choice of datatype and size."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "then he can input element values at different points. then there should be a menu which asks user about what he want  to do. Like create Array, delete Array, assign values, sort array this opens a sub menu that ask if he wants to sort by bubble, selection or insertion. Also search in array, this also have a submenu that ask if he to do that using linear search or binary search."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			},
